      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update:\nAfter playing around with this bug I found a solution!\nIf the starting state (Orange state) in thr Locomotion Layer has Foot IK enabled, it messes up foot tracking for some odd reason.\nAs you might have guessed, disabling it fixes the problem.\nDon't worry about it for now though, my suspicion is that bug tied in the FBT IK bug that has been going on here for quite some time, meaning: if the devs fix that FBT IK bug, it will also fix that other bug I'm talking about.\nThis is only my suspicion, I could potentially be wrong.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
