  "created": "2021-05-01T06:08:11.946Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Legs on Desktop mode will rotate its X-rotation 90° only if using custom idle animations (probably crouching and proning as well) if Right Leg and Left Leg Component are set to Tracking as far as I can tell.\nThis doesn't happen on proxy animations though.",
